SUMMARY:FUN RIDE - EP East Pete West (16 F) RSVP Required
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nRide leader: Volunteer to
  lead!\nRide Sweep: Volunteer to Sweep\nAnticipated Average Pace: \\~11 mp
 h\nRoute: [EP East Pete West (16 F)](https://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/
 cue/ep-east-pete-west-16-f/)\n\n**Be Safe\, Have Fun\, and Ride Together**
 \n\nWithout a volunteer leader\, this event is Show and Go.\nThe departure
  location is the same as the Tour de Red Rose\, just an hour later\, so th
 ere will be other cyclists to help but on a different route.\nIf you want 
 to volunteer to lead\, leave a comment for this ride\, or contact Rick Zoo
 k.\n\nThis is a FUN RIDE ride. The ride leader will ride at the advertised
  average speed. This is intended to be a group ride with a no-drop rule as
  the main goal. The ride leader will do his/her best to keep the group tog
 ether with occasional regroupings and/or splitting into multiple groups to
  align to pace capabilities.\n\nPlease do not join this ride if you are no
 t willing to ride with the group.\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No earbuds. Pl
 ease bring water and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/C
 O2 inflator).\n\nTo eliminate passing around a pen and paper waiver\, we r
 equire LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to join this ride. Being 
 on Meetup does not mean you are a club member. Join here [Member Signup](h
 ttps://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148)\n
 Your RSVP is your agreement to abide by the club's Code of Conduct: [Code 
 of Conduct](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club
 _id=257148&module_id=323984)\n\nGuidance if an incident occurs: [Incident 
 Actions](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257
 148&module_id=326137)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3154876
 27/
